          "summary": "Cap Ono's Section 8.2 non-compete at 12 months and end it automatically on Array's failure to meet service levels or delivery dates under Article 9; conform Array's termination trigger.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Section 8.2 binds Ono to an open-ended non-compete with no performance-based exit, so we capped Ono's side at twelve (12) months and made it end automatically if Array misses service levels or delivery dates under its Article 9 supply obligations. Array's reciprocal covenant is untouched, and we conformed Array's termination trigger to the capped covenant.",
