              "paragraphId": "p0492",
              "text": "The obligations of Ono and its Affiliates under this Section 8.2 shall in no event continue beyond the twelve (12) month anniversary of the Effective Date, and shall terminate automatically if Array fails to meet its supply obligations under Article 9 of this Agreement, including any service levels or delivery dates agreed by the Parties or set forth in any supply agreement entered into pursuant to Article 9."
            },
            {
              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0492",
